    ],
    "summary": "From the creator of Pony Island and The Hex comes the latest mind melting, self-destructing love letter to video games. Inscryption is an inky black card-based odyssey that blends the deckbuilding roguelike, escape-room style puzzles, and psychological horror into a blood-laced smoothie. Darker still are the secrets inscrybed upon the cards...\r\nIn Inscryption you will...\r\nAcquire a deck of woodland creature cards by draft, surgery, and self mutilation\r\nUnlock the secrets lurking behind the walls of Leshy's cabin\r\nEmbark on an unexpected and deeply disturbing odyssey",
    "developer": "Daniel Mullins Games",
    "reviews": []
