    ],
    "summary": "Unpacking is a zen puzzle game about the familiar experience of pulling possessions out of boxes and fitting them into a new home. Part “item Tetris”, part home decoration, you are invited to create a satisfying living space while learning clues about the life you’re unpacking. Over the course of eight house moves, you are given a chance to experience a sense of intimacy with a character you never see and a story you’re never told.\nFeatures\nUnpack a home -- from a single bedroom to an entire house\nMeditative gameplay with no timers, meters or score\nExplore domestic environments with all their nooks and crannies while you stack plates, hang towels, and arrange bookshelves\nDiscover a character's story through the items that come with her to each new home (and the items that get left behind)\n",
    "developer": "Witch Beam",
    "reviews": []
