    "summary": "Shady Part of Me is a puzzle game, where gameplay serves narration.\nThe player will be invited to play two little girls.\nOne is the shadow of the other.\nAlong convoluted scenes, story twists and surprising memos, their story takes place. They evolve. They try to cooperate and reach their common goal : freedom.\nShady Part Of Me is a solo game.\nThere are Two Girls but One Character.\nAnd therefore One Player.\nKey Features\nSwitch from 2D to 3D at will\nPlay with light, shadows and perspective to overcome obstacles\nArt rendering in watercolor like style\nThe puzzle is your mind and you have to break the dream.\nLive the drawn narrative journey of your character\nEvolve in a world where light and shadow really follow the laws of physics",
    "developer": "Douze Dixièmes",
    "reviews": []
  },
