    "summary": "School Years is a series of visual novel adapted from real stories. It is divided into three stages: high school, University and social work to tell a common and tortuous life trajectory.\nHere is the first chapter of the series.In this chapter you will experience the life of a high school student in China. The protagonist lives and studies under the background of examination-oriented education in senior high schools in China with the expectation of the future and the expectation of ignorance of emotions. During his junior year, he has experienced many things which deeply impressed on him. This part of the story is more a pave for the development of the following chapters, but also plays a role of \"appetizer\" and is very exciting. Welcome to experience, thank you.^^",
