    "summary": "Beat your best scores in Neon Beats, a 2D platformer game with rhythm based levels!\nYou just entered an abstract world and embody a cube moving on a white line.\nA relaxing and catchy music starts to play along with colourful shining neon lights all around.\nYour first jump, not so difficult, is followed by a swing above sharp spikes and a slide down to the depth.\nDeeper you progress in the levels, harder the challenges become.\nQuickly, the rhythm is accelerating.\n\nYour superlanding on the ground triggers an exciting music drop, and a killing wall starts chasing you.\nThe only way to survive is to run.\nA boost makes your speed increase drastically and the finish line is only a few jumps away.\nYou dodge a first spike, get bumped over a second, and perform the perfect jump to the end.\nThe traje",
