    "summary": "SYNTHETIK has all the core components of a great rogue-lite - an insurmountable objective defended by relentless opponents and unforgiving bosses encased in ever-changing environments filled with a massive cache of weapons, items, perks and upgrades to discover.\nJoin the fight alone or through seamless 2 player online co-op, but be careful; every fumble could mean the end. Can you defeat the Heart of Armageddon?\nWith Synthetik we wanted to bring new depth and mechanics to the genre while leaving a lot of freedom for experimentation and different playstyles. It is inspired by the 2000 Era of games when people put in all the Features they enjoyed without streamlining to the bare minimum. Synthetik offers uniquely deep and satisfying weapon mechanics and a tremendous amount of customization, ",
