    ],
    "summary": "Timespinner is a 2D Metroidvania about Lunais, a young woman who is stranded on a foreign world after the evil Lachiem Empire eradicated her clan. With the Timespinner destroyed and having no hope of returning to the past or her home world, she vows to get revenge on the Emperor himself.\nExplore a vast connected world with beautifully drawn pixel art environments. Travel through time to witness the barren present and the lush past of the planet of Lachiem. Collect elemental orbs and mix their powers to destroy your foes with blades and spells. Befriend mysterious familiars and train them to aid you in battle. Take down an entire Empire!",
