    "summary": "In Morphblade you move around a grid slicing, smashing and bursting waves of nasty red bugs. Each tile you move to transforms you into a different weapon: on a Blades hex you can slice enemies on either side of you, on an Arrow you can launch yourself through two enemies in a row. Between waves, you choose how to build out the grid, and upgrade your most used hexes with new abilities.\nHammer: lets you stay put and smash a single enemy in front of you\nBlades: kill enemies on either side as you move\nArrow: plunge right through an enemy and come out the other side\nRepair: repairs any damage you've taken when you move here\nTeleport: move to anywhere else on the grid\nAcid: strips tough enemies of their armour, leaving them vulnerable\nKilling bugs earns you upgrades for your hexes, and each hex ",
